.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351830/extras/f898f716686610fc990e1e3fd6dd0802.poster.avif?t=1735115139\" width=800 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351830/extras/f898f716686610fc990e1e3fd6dd0802.webm?t=1735115139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351830/extras/f898f716686610fc990e1e3fd6dd0802.mp4?t=1735115139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Arrow Keys or WASD to Move, use space to Jump, use j &amp; k to attack, use E to interact, use L to dash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please kill the monsters entrenched in the town and interact with the teleportation elevator, find your way to reach the streetlight in the endpoint, uncovering the secrets hidden behind the town.</p>",
